§§ `Ordinance s 17 (saved by Law s 31): publication and the day validity begins`

-- tests: O17
-- Regulations of legislative effect must be published in Reshumot; regulations that are not of legislative effect are outside the section.
#ASSERT `Ordinance s 17 — the regulation must be published in Reshumot:` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS NOTHING, `published in some other way on` IS NOTHING)
#ASSERT `Ordinance s 17 — the regulation must be published in Reshumot:` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 14), `published in some other way on` IS NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT `Ordinance s 17 — the regulation must be published in Reshumot:` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS FALSE, `published in Reshumot on` IS NOTHING, `published in some other way on` IS NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT `Ordinance s 17 — the regulation must be published in Reshumot:` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS FALSE, `published in Reshumot on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 14), `published in some other way on` IS NOTHING)
-- Validity begins on the day of publication (the day itself is included), if no other provision fixes the day.
#ASSERT NOT `Ordinance s 17 — the validity of the regulation has begun by` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 14), `published in some other way on` IS NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 5 13) `, unless another provision fixes the day:` NOTHING
#ASSERT `Ordinance s 17 — the validity of the regulation has begun by` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 14), `published in some other way on` IS NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 5 14) `, unless another provision fixes the day:` NOTHING
#ASSERT `Ordinance s 17 — the validity of the regulation has begun by` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 14), `published in some other way on` IS NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 5 15) `, unless another provision fixes the day:` NOTHING
#ASSERT `Ordinance s 17 — the validity of the regulation has begun by` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 14), `published in some other way on` IS NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2030 1 1) `, unless another provision fixes the day:` NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT `Ordinance s 17 — the validity of the regulation has begun by` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 14), `published in some other way on` IS NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 1 1) `, unless another provision fixes the day:` NOTHING
-- Another provision fixes the day: validity begins on that day, published or not.
#ASSERT NOT `Ordinance s 17 — the validity of the regulation has begun by` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 14), `published in some other way on` IS NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 5 31) `, unless another provision fixes the day:` (JUST (YMD 2026 6 1))
#ASSERT `Ordinance s 17 — the validity of the regulation has begun by` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 14), `published in some other way on` IS NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, unless another provision fixes the day:` (JUST (YMD 2026 6 1))
#ASSERT `Ordinance s 17 — the validity of the regulation has begun by` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 14), `published in some other way on` IS NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 6 2) `, unless another provision fixes the day:` (JUST (YMD 2026 6 1))
#ASSERT NOT `Ordinance s 17 — the validity of the regulation has begun by` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS NOTHING, `published in some other way on` IS NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 5 31) `, unless another provision fixes the day:` (JUST (YMD 2026 6 1))
#ASSERT `Ordinance s 17 — the validity of the regulation has begun by` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS NOTHING, `published in some other way on` IS NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, unless another provision fixes the day:` (JUST (YMD 2026 6 1))
-- A regulation of legislative effect not yet published, with no other provision, has no day under this section: its validity has not begun under s 17.
#ASSERT NOT `Ordinance s 17 — the validity of the regulation has begun by` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS NOTHING, `published in some other way on` IS NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 5 14) `, unless another provision fixes the day:` NOTHING
-- The other provision may give an earlier day than the publication.
#ASSERT `Ordinance s 17 — the validity of the regulation has begun by` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 14), `published in some other way on` IS NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 5 1) `, unless another provision fixes the day:` (JUST (YMD 2026 5 1))
-- A regulation that is not of legislative effect is outside s 17.
#ASSERT REFUSED `Ordinance s 17 — the validity of the regulation has begun by` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS FALSE, `published in Reshumot on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 14), `published in some other way on` IS NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 5 14) `, unless another provision fixes the day:` NOTHING BECAUSE "Ordinance s 17 speaks only of regulations of legislative effect"

-- Publication some other way (a newspaper) is not publication in Reshumot and starts nothing under s 17.
#ASSERT NOT `Ordinance s 17 — the validity of the regulation has begun by` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS NOTHING, `published in some other way on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 10)) `on` (YMD 2026 5 14) `, unless another provision fixes the day:` NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT `Ordinance s 17 — the validity of the regulation has begun by` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS NOTHING, `published in some other way on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 10)) `on` (YMD 2030 1 1) `, unless another provision fixes the day:` NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT `Ordinance s 17 — the validity of the regulation has begun by` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 20), `published in some other way on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 10)) `on` (YMD 2026 5 15) `, unless another provision fixes the day:` NOTHING
#ASSERT `Ordinance s 17 — the validity of the regulation has begun by` (`A regulation measured against s 17 of the Ordinance for publication` WITH `of legislative effect` IS TRUE, `published in Reshumot on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 20), `published in some other way on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 10)) `on` (YMD 2026 5 20) `, unless another provision fixes the day:` NOTHING
